tieng_Anh:
Card effects have Spell Speeds.
The greater the Spell Speed, the easier you can add it to a chain.
@2Spell Speed 3@0: Counter Traps
@5Spell Speed 2@0: Quick-Play Spells, Traps, Multi-Trigger Monster Effects
@6Spell Speed 1@0: Spell and Monster Effects that are not in the above categories
You can only chain if your Spell Speed is equal or greater.
However, @2a Spell Speed 1 effect cannot activate a chain.@0

tieng_Viet_hien_tai:
Mỗi Effect lá bài đều có Spell Speed.
Spell Speed càng cao thì càng dễ thêm vào Chain.
@2Spell Speed 3@0: Counter Trap
@5Spell Speed 2@0: Quick-Play Spell, Trap, Effect Multi-Trigger của Monster
@6Spell Speed 1@0: Effect Spell và Monster không thuộc các loại trên
Bạn chỉ có thể tạo Chain nếu Spell Speed của bạn bằng hoặc cao hơn.
Tuy nhiên, @2hiệu ứng Spell Speed 1 không thể Activate để tạo Chain.@0

tieng_Anh:
Cards are divided into 6 major types.
@4Green-colored@0 cards are Spell Cards, purple-colored cards are Trap Cards, and the other 4 colors are Monster Cards.
Those colors are:
@6Yellow-colored@0 cards are Normal Monster Cards
@7Orange-colored@0 cards are Effect Monster Cards
@1Blue-colored@0 cards are Ritual Monster Cards
@3Violet-colored@0 cards are Fusion Monster Cards

A Duel takes place on the Duel Field.
The card type determines where a card will be placed on the Duel Field.
You and your opponent each have a Field consisting of:
5 spaces in the @2Monster Card Zone@0
5 spaces in the @3Spell & Trap Card Zone@0
1 space in the @4Field Card Zone@0
@5Deck Zone@0
@6Fusion Deck Zone@0
@7Graveyard@0

tieng_Viet_hien_tai:
Duel diễn ra trên Duel Field.
Loại lá bài quyết định nơi đặt lá trên Duel Field.
Bạn và Opponent mỗi người có một Field gồm:
5 ô @2Monster Zone@0
5 ô @3Spell & Trap Zone@0
1 ô @4Field Zone@0
@5Deck Zone@0
@6Fusion Deck Zone@0
@7Graveyard@0
